    {
      "id": "4becdda9-b960-42b9-8051-6633faa0a22e",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 772,
        "content": "## Respond to Google reviews with AI, Google Sheets, Discord and Gmail\n\n### How it works\n\n1. A review arrives as a webhook POST with the business name, reviewer, rating, and review text. Connect it to Google Business Profile, a form, or any tool that sends review data.\n2. The workflow validates the review, then an AI agent drafts a personalized, on-brand response from the review text, rating, and business name.\n3. Every review and its draft response are logged to Google Sheets.\n4. Negative reviews alert the team on Discord and email the draft to the owner for approval. Positive reviews are shared on Discord.\n5. Every Monday a weekly digest with review stats and AI highlights is emailed and posted to Discord.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Connect Google Sheets, Gmail, Discord, and OpenAI credentials.\n- Create a spreadsheet with a Reviews sheet and update the Google Sheets nodes with its ID.\n- Point the Discord nodes at your review channel and set the owner email in the Gmail nodes.\n\n### Customization\n\n- Change the AI prompt, the negative review threshold, or the weekly schedule to match your process."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
